<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Biggest gains/falls for ASX 100 index in last week-Oct 28.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Biggest gains/falls for ASX 100 index in last week-Oct 28.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is a list of the 10 largest gaining and falling stocks for Australian companies included in the Australian Stock Exchange's ASX 100 index for the week to October 25.</p>
<p>Top 10 largest gains in week</p>
<p>Rank Name				    Price     pct change</p>
<p>1   AGL			   6.99	6.72</p>
<p>2   Southcorp		   3.79	5.28</p>
<p>3   Lion Nathan		 3.26	5.16</p>
<p>4   QNI			   2.60	4.00</p>
<p>5   Plutonic Resources	6.20	3.68</p>
<p>6   Lend Lease		 21.25	3.66</p>
<p>7   Bank of Melbourne	 8.65	3.59</p>
<p>8   Rothmans		    7.87	3.55</p>
<p>9   Commonwealth Bank	11.76	3.43</p>
<p>10  Simsmetal		   6.95	2.51</p>
<p>Top 10 largest falls in week</p>
<p>Rank Name				    Price     pct change</p>
<p>1   Cortecs		     3.55     -16.47</p>
<p>2   Email			 3.44	-8.75</p>
<p>3   Sydney Harbour Casino   1.69	-6.63</p>
<p>4   Caltex			4.40	-6.38</p>
<p>5   North			 3.60	-6.01</p>
<p>6   Davids			1.73	-5.98</p>
<p>7   Village prefs	     3.48	-5.95</p>
<p>8   News Corp prefs	   5.70	-5.94</p>
<p>9   Goodman Fielder	   1.45	-5.23</p>
<p>10  Brierley Investments    1.14	-5.00</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373-1800</p>
